From 4d4720c3115efbbcb24e07f6b366cf74863a0f2e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 06:22:56 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] build: Wasmtime 36 LTS, zip 9, calamine 0.38; cargo deny
 over the workspace (D5)

cargo deny --workspace found 30 advisories in Wasmtime 38.0.4 (out of
support), plus zip 8 (also through rust_xlsxwriter), calamine 0.36,
tokio and pulldown-cmark. Wasmtime and wasmtime-wasi are pinned to the
36.0.20 LTS (Rust 1.86; every fix, unaffected by the later ones); all ten
plugin sandbox tests pass. zip 9.5, calamine 0.38, rust_xlsxwriter 0.102.
Cargo resolves to versions supporting Rust 1.88. Accepted advisories are
listed with reasons. Box's crates are publish = false; the notices say
GPL-3.0-or-later, not MIT. CI gains the deny job and the native-notices
check after the AppImage build.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015owd4wcAhMR1xnKP9qs3Tf
